; targets: enc
; The encoding of the atomic words (30-mn-core.hbnf, group mn-atom; manual 7.4, 9.13; errata 211): three forms of their own, so that the address is written `(Ra)` (the shape b5d0s-x1 is a base
; register with no displacement: the same five bits as a register, written in parentheses and with no offset), and three leaves.
;
;   ATOM, ATOM4   `op Rd, Rs, (Ra)`  the 20 read-modify-write words (compare and swap, swap, add, and, or, exclusive or, the signed and unsigned maximum and minimum, each with its `db` form) and
;          the store-conditional: ATOM the eight-byte words, ATOM4 the four-byte words (two forms because a leaf with a sub-opcode field of its own is the only leaf of its form); the last bit of
;          the 12-bit prefix is the size of the access.  Four bytes each.
;   ATOML  `ll Rd, (Ra)`      the load-linked, eight bytes and four bytes: two registers, so it is a leaf of its own (a third register field would be a field the instruction ignores, and an
;          ignored field is a field a later instruction could not use).  Four bytes.
;
; They were words of the generated forms R3 (the atomics except the compare and swap) and R4 (the compare and swap, with four registers).  The generator no longer puts a word of a hand-written
; group in a form of its own (tools/encopt/addforms.py), so the two forms keep the prefixes they had and the prefixes below are first-parcel patterns that no leaf used (tools/mkenc.py fails,
; naming the overlap, if they are not free): sixteen patterns for each of ATOM and ATOM4, one for ATOML.
forms =/ "ATOM" | "ATOM4" | "ATOML"
form-ATOM = o1:reg5 o2:reg5 o3:b5d0s-x1
leaf-ATOM-1 = 0b111111100000 xsub:5 o1-r:5 o2-r:5 o3-base:5 ?(xsub < 21)
sub-ATOM-1 = "cas" | "casdb" | "swap" | "swapdb" | "xadd" | "xadddb" | "xand" | "xanddb" | "xor_" | "xor_db" | "xxor" | "xxordb" | "xmax" | "xmaxdb" | "xmin" | "xmindb" | "xmaxu" | "xmaxudb" | "xminu" | "xminudb" | "sc"
form-ATOM4 = o1:reg5 o2:reg5 o3:b5d0s-x1
leaf-ATOM4-1 = 0b111111100001 xsub:5 o1-r:5 o2-r:5 o3-base:5 ?(xsub < 21)
sub-ATOM4-1 = "casl" | "casldb" | "swapl" | "swapldb" | "xaddl" | "xaddldb" | "xandl" | "xandldb" | "xor_l" | "xor_ldb" | "xxorl" | "xxorldb" | "xmaxl" | "xmaxldb" | "xminl" | "xminldb" | "xmaxul" | "xmaxuldb" | "xminul" | "xminuldb" | "scl"
form-ATOML = o1:reg5 o2:b5d0s-x1
leaf-ATOML-1 = 0b1111111000100000 xsub:6 o1-r:5 o2-base:5 ?(xsub < 2)
sub-ATOML-1 = "ll" | "lll"
